      "body": "If you want to learn something in deep then try to explain it to others. This is the famous advice from one of the most famous Nobel Prize winning Physicists Richard Feynman. So, writing something with the intention of communicating it to others is the best way to get to know it better yourself first. And you'll be surprised how little you knew about it!",
