      "id": 14977237,
      "body": "Totally agree. When trying to break down complex ideas into logical structure you also detach yourself from your \"box\" and your perspective and this can bring you new valuable insights. And often does when I do it.\n\nCrafting public documents is also a high leverage activity and can bring you a lot of recognition in the organisation if you do it well.\n\nI started writing on substack too, with one of the goals to improve as a writer, but also that's a different type of writing than I do at my engineering job and I think I'm enjoying it so far\n",
      "body_json": {
        "type": "doc",
        "attrs": {
          "schemaVersion": "v1"
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Totally agree. When trying to break down complex ideas into logical structure you also detach yourself from your \"box\" and your perspective and this can bring you new valuable insights. And often does when I do it."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Crafting public documents is also a high leverage activity and can bring you a lot of recognition in the organisation if you do it well."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "I started writing on substack too, with one of the goals to improve as a writer, but also that's a different type of writing than I do at my engineering job and I think I'm enjoying it so far"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
